ent-ActionArcaneGoreExecution = gore execution
    .desc = Arms the rifle. The next shot rips the head off a living target, leaving its brain and eyes behind.
ent-ActionArcaneTargetLock = target lock
    .desc = Pick a living creature to lock the camera onto. The next shot flies straight at it.

arcane-gore-execution-on = The rifle hungers. The next shot will take a head.
arcane-gore-execution-off = The rifle calms down.
arcane-target-lock-locked = Target locked.
arcane-target-lock-none = There is no living target there.
